WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Paul wrote to the Galatians: in
Christ there is neither Jew nor Greek,

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.410
slave nor free, male nor female.

3
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.520
Genesis says God created
humans in his own image:

4
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.120
male and female he created them.

5
00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:19.720
Yet the Catholic and Orthodox
Churches ordain only men as priests.

6
00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.000
So if religions teach
that everyone is equal,

7
00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:26.550
why do some still give women
and men different roles?

8
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.290
In this mission, you'll
learn how prejudice,

9
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.430
an attitude, differs from
discrimination, an action.

10
00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:37.790
Then you'll chart how different Churches
decide who may lead their worship,

11
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.810
and why they disagree.

12
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:45.710
Your mission: find out why believers who
teach equality still disagree about roles.
